# Only what the image build needs; keep the context small.
*
# The locked dependencies and the package (build stages `deps` and `app`).
!backend/pyproject.toml
!backend/uv.lock
!backend/README.md
!backend/src/
# The s6 services and scripts of the runtime image.
!deploy/image/
# The web UI's sources (build stage `web`), without what the build makes or does not need.
!web/
web/node_modules/
web/build/
web/.svelte-kit/
web/src/lib/paraglide/
web/tests/
web/**/*.test.ts
web/**/*.md
web/openapi.json
web/playwright.config.ts
# Bytecode caches of the host.
**/__pycache__/
